  "notes": "{示|しめ}す means to show, indicate, or demonstrate something.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- Takes を particle for the object shown\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- Xを{示|しめ}す: to show/indicate X\n- Xで{示|しめ}す: to show by means of X\n- Xに{示|しめ}す: to show to X (person)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {方向|ほうこう}を{示|しめ}す: to indicate direction\n- {例|れい}を{示|しめ}す: to give an example\n- {態度|たいど}を{示|しめ}す: to show one's attitude\n- {興味|きょうみ}を{示|しめ}す: to show interest\n- {証拠|しょうこ}を{示|しめ}す: to present evidence\n\nRELATED COMPOUNDS:\n- {指示|しじ}: instruction, direction\n- {表示|ひょうじ}: display, indication\n- {提示|ていじ}: presentation\n- {暗示|あんじ}: hint, suggestion\n\nNUANCE:\n{示|しめ}す often implies making something visible or clear to others, whether physical (pointing) or abstract (demonstrating a concept).",
